{"title":"Bloodhound’s Regression Instinct","synopsis":"“Yan,” sang protagonis, dicuci otak oleh kaisar dan hidup sebagai bonekanya. Setelah mengetahui dia dipermainkan oleh kaisar, dia berencana untuk membalas dendam, namun pingsan karena kekuatan kaisar. Dia pikir dia telah mati, tetapi ketika dia bangun, dia menyadari bahwa dia telah mengalami kemunduran ke saat dia masih menjadi anggota baru. Entah untuk membalas dendam pada kaisar atau mencari keluarganya. Pilihan ada di tangannya.","alternative_title":"사냥개의 회귀본능, Bloodhound's Regression Instinct","author":"Arco (아크로)","artist":"Studio W (스튜디오 W)","genres":["Action","Drama","Fantasy"],"chapters":[{"id":"845f0cae-2e2a-4030-a694-a941966c2cfd","number":"100","title":"Chapter 100","date":"2026-01-19","images":[]},{"id":"e5818d48-c72f-4d0a-bf7d-adea28288204","number":"99","title":"Chapter 99","date":"2026-01-19","images":[]},{"id":"de612748-1ded-4308-8cc4-8de91f9d4a54","number":"98","title":"Chapter 98","date":"2026-01-01","images":[]},{"id":"857d055d-2811-4de9-bfe2-0923d9d4e1f6","number":"97","title":"Chapter 97","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"id":"a783ec89-cfb8-42ad-881a-b43a4d85c2fc","number":"96","title":"Chapter 96","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"id":"38662015-c5ca-4e54-a426-62119fe894d2","number":"95","title":"Chapter 95","date":"2025-12-26","images":[]},{"id":"f9d6186b-8a6f-4b22-bbec-752462240707","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2025-12-13","images":[]},{"id":"63f96f9b-ffce-45ca-aaae-f227cad3e075","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2025-12-13","images":[]},{"id":"d6fd68d7-168d-496d-b138-e9fc80df156d","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"id":"ae6bc0c8-a4f8-4b36-90b8-fb1becfb5a15","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2025-12-09","images":[]},{"id":"fe9a9681-7efe-4d01-9321-038d78e79e50","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2025-11-11","images":[]},{"id":"4d5bd2f4-8774-47c0-886e-58a400d9fb33","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2025-10